API implementation details:
- AccountQualityMonitoringService.ListDegradedQualityAccounts scans only OAuth accounts using the existing repository filter.
- It merges persisted account extra status, latest quality run state, account ErrorMessage, and quality history to detect degraded/401 records.
- HTTP 401 is returned as an item field (`http_status: 401`); unauthenticated API calls still return normal HTTP 401 and are not converted into data items.
- Route: GET /api/v1/admin/account-quality/degraded-accounts.
